---
name: "Fix Plan Review"
description: "Fixes plan-stage self-review findings within scope"
tags: [plan, review]
stage: plan
---

## Input

Read `${{ openspecChangeDir }}/self-review.md` directly. It is the authoritative source for what needs to be fixed in the plan artifacts.

## Process

1. Read the issue context and plan artifacts:
   - `${{ openspecChangeDir }}/proposal.md`
   - `${{ openspecChangeDir }}/specs/`
   - `${{ openspecChangeDir }}/design.md`
   - `${{ openspecChangeDir }}/tasks.json`
2. Read `${{ openspecChangeDir }}/self-review.md`.
3. Fix every finding in `self-review.md`.
4. Do not skip small issues. Do not skip test issues. Do not leave follow-ups.
5. Read the full self-review first, then fix all findings in one pass.
6. Re-run any plan-stage verification the findings reference.
7. Verify that every finding from `self-review.md` is resolved.

## Rules

- Do not rely on marker-check output or server-provided summaries to decide what to fix.
- Apply all repairs described in `self-review.md`.
- Do not make unrelated changes.
- Do not edit `self-review.md`; the next self-review task will regenerate it.

## Output

```markdown
## Applied Plan Review Repairs
1. [file:line] What changed

## Verification
- Re-verifications run and result
```
